# oc-sim scenario v1
# Open the app menu by holding up and down together, move the highlight down
# one entry, and launch with the left encoder. The two buttons go down forty
# ticks apart, the way a hand actually presses them: neither may fire its own
# action on the way in. CV1 and CV2 carry different levels throughout, so the
# scope's buffered mult proves the switch on the jacks as well as on screen.
ticks 600
0   cv 1 1500
0   patch 1 on
0   cv 2 4000
0   patch 2 on
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
120 button left down
126 button left up
# Once the scope is running, walk CV1 up and down so the golden snapshot shows
# a real trace rather than a flat line.
200 cv 1 -2000
280 cv 1 5000
360 cv 1 0
440 cv 1 3000
520 cv 1 1500
